{
 "_about": "Damage-model constants for a Monster Hunter Wilds build optimizer (game Ver 1.041). User assumptions: hitzone = 100 for raw and element, no monster resistance, every hit lands. Primary source is the game data dump dtlnor/MHWs-in-json (PlayerStatusParam, PlayerSkillParam, SkillData); community sources are only used where the dump is not yet decoded. 'true' units everywhere unless a key says display (display attack = true x bloat, display element = true x 10). Keys marked VERIFY are interpretations of raw parameter arrays that still need an in-game check.",
 "formula": {
  "raw_per_hit": "trueRawFinal * MV/100 * sharpRaw * critRaw * hitzoneRaw/100 * postMultipliers",
  "element_per_hit": "min(trueEleFinal, eleCap) * sharpEle * critEle * hitzoneEle/100",
  "trueRawFinal": "(baseTrueRaw * prod(attack_pct multipliers) + sum(flat attack)) ; percent sources: Attack Boost 4/5, Heroics, Offensive Guard, Lord's Soul, Seregios II, Prayers II, Fortify",
  "trueEleFinal": "(baseTrueEle * prod(ele_pct multipliers) + sum(flat element)) capped by element_cap ; percent sources: element attack Lv2/3, Coalescence, Charge Master, Gogmapocalypse, Dark Arts",
  "critRaw": "1 + aff/100 * (critMult - 1) for aff in [0,100]; 1 + |aff|/100 * (0.75 - 1) for aff < 0",
  "critEle": "1 + max(aff,0)/100 * (critEleMult - 1) only with Critical Element equipped, else 1",
  "efr_efe": "Effective Raw = trueRawFinal * sharpRaw * critRaw ; Effective Element = min(trueEleFinal,cap) * sharpEle * critEle. Weapon-combo independent, so the optimizer can rank builds on EFR + EFE per 100 MV. Motion values exist in the dump (Wp??_Attack.rcol '_Attack' field) for a later combo-DPS mode.",
  "stacking_note": "Community consensus (wiggler.pet): ((Base * Raw%) + Flat) * Post. Which percent sources multiply vs add to each other is NOT verified for Wilds - treat as multiplicative and flag.",
  "ranking_metric": "Decided 2026-10-06: rank builds on EFR + EFE (both, summed per 100 MV). Since 2026-10-07 plus proc damage per 100 MV.",
  "proc_damage": "Extra damage instances, converted to damage per 100 MV of landed attacks with the attack profile (hits_per_minute, average_mv, charged_lv3_share; weapon presets GS 24/120/0.3, LS 50/35/0): procDamage = damage * procsPerHit / (average_mv/100), procsPerHit = chance * min(1, secondsPerHit / cooldown). Azure Bolt: fixed + thunder x Thunder Attack (x1.0 +4 / x1.1 +5 / x1.2 +6), 30 s cooldown. Dark Arts shockwave (GS, VERIFY): on charged_lv3_share of hits, EFR x 0.30 + 6 true dragon x sharpEle, counted without red health. Bad Blood: 45 / 85 with Resentment + red health, 2 s cooldown. Scorcher: 20+60 / 40+120, 33 % per 2.4 s check, not scaled by Fire Attack. Hitzone 100 like the rest of the model."
 },
 "constants_from_game_data": {
  "critical_multiplier": 1.25,
  "negative_critical_multiplier": 0.75,
  "affinity_cap": 100,
  "element_cap_true": "max(baseTrueEle * 2.3, baseTrueEle + 40)   (PlayerStatusParam _ElementAttack_RateLimit 2.3 / _AddLimit 40; same 2.3 for bowguns)",
  "element_cap_display": "max(baseDisplay * 2.3, baseDisplay + 400)",
  "raw_cap_true": "max(base * 4.0, base + 400) per source class; all sources max(base * 5.0, base + 600) - never reached in practice",
  "status_cap": "base * 1.6",
  "frenzy_overcome": {
   "affinity": 15,
   "duration_s": 60,
   "note": "base Frenzy mechanic; this is what Black Eclipse I gives you (plus the Frenzy outbreak risk)"
  },
  "gunner_defense_rate": 0.7
 },
